    "updated_at": "2018-01-25T10:23:51Z",
    "body": "I tend to agree with @Ms2ger having read step 4 of https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#cropped-to-the-source-rectangle-with-formatting.\r\n\r\nHowever, in the case the input is too large, we should fail, and that is not defined. (It is tested by http://w3c-test.org/2dcontext/imagebitmap/createImageBitmap-invalid-args.html to throw an \"InvalidStateError\" however...)",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
