    "updated_at": "2018-01-26T11:17:24Z",
    "body": "And I guess it should fail if resizeWidth/resizeHeight are too large. Which is tricky since we currently don't have a good way to fail the cropping \"subalgorithm\".\r\n\r\nAre there other ways this could fail?",
