    "updated_at": "2018-01-26T18:28:22Z",
    "body": "Yeah, I was thinking that when I get around to it I could fix #1553 as well and move cropping and resizing to \"in parallel\". The cleanup I worked on today seemed good to do before that to make the method a little less unwieldy.",
